# Apache-2.0; crates/koru-blocks/assets/README.md says why it is needed.
file crates/koru-blocks/assets/TypeScript.sublime-syntax 28ee3a665973468be16e44c89fdae5cf1f865680132c086b6973c2b3900dfb5e https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sharkdp/bat/v0.24.0/assets/syntaxes/02_Extra/TypeScript.sublime-syntax

